ime delegation you can verify over \"fire many\n   and wait.\" If you spawn several Task calls, remember each already returned its\n   result by the time you read this — go verify each on disk now.\n=== log tail ===\n{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5\",\"id\":\"msg_bdrk_o4xzyeqj5lu3xfblde3oav6bwnez5iic5pmp7zjkc3fxuszbienq\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"PID namespace per tool call kills detached children. Running the full verification synchronously instead (3 in parallel, 16 cores):\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":660,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":48436,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":660,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":2,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"a559c5f0-514a-47ee-9a1d-90afb14938b0\",\"uuid\":\"63005ece-fb69-45c9-844d-0a40a5e06c8c\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-17T20:24:30.664Z\"}\n{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5\",\"id\":\"msg_bdrk_o4xzyeqj5lu3xfblde3oav6bwnez5iic5pmp7zjkc3fxuszbienq\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_bdrk_01WtBPrUDMddwReFXt5bkdEr\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"R=/local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-translate-zX9kj4/translated_rust/target/release/driver\\n$TMPDIR/ctest/driver 42 > $TMPDIR/full_c_42.txt 2>&1 &\\np1=$!\\n$R 1 > $TMPDIR/full_r_1.txt 2>&1 &\\np2=$!\\n$R 42 > $TMPDIR/full_r_42.txt 2>&1 &\\np3=$!\\ntime wait $p1 $p2 $p3\\necho \\\"=== FULL (ITERATIONS=2000) RESULTS ===\\\"\\necho \\\"C seed 1  (measured earlier): 42032659\\\"\\necho \\\"R seed 1 : $(cat $TMPDIR/full_r_1.txt)\\\"\\necho \\\"C seed 42: $(cat $TMPDIR/full_c_42.txt)\\\"\\necho \\\"R seed 42: $(cat $TMPDIR/full_r_42.txt)\\\"\",\"timeout\":600000}}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"st